==English==

===Etymology===
''[[drag]]'' + ''[[queen]]''

===Pronunciation===
{{audio|En-us-ncalif-dragqueen.ogg|Audio (US, Northern California)}}

====Alternate forms====
*[[dragqueen]]

===Noun===
{{en-noun|sg=[[drag]] [[queen]]}}

# {{colloquial}} A [[male]] who dresses up in [[women]]'s [[clothing]], typically for public performance. The man's [[clothing]] and [[makeup]] are typically greatly [[exaggerate]]d, so the end result is typically a [[parody]] of women in general.

